sequenceDiagram
    participant App as User app
    participant Server as XMPP network
    participant Travel as Travel agent
    participant Specialist as Specialist agent

    App->>Server: Discover services
    Server-->>App: Addressable agent directory
    App->>Travel: Plan my disrupted trip
    Travel->>Specialist: Ask: what does policy allow?
    Specialist-->>Travel: Answer with constraints
    Travel->>Specialist: Delegate pinned rebooking task
    Specialist-->>Travel: Accepted with durable task ID
    Travel-->>App: Progress and final itinerary
